<title>FRANCE: TPS has no comment on subscription numbers.</title>
<headline>TPS has no comment on subscription numbers.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Television Par Satellite (TPS) French digital satellite television venture had no comment on newspaper reports it had more than 20,000 subscribers since its December start.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman for TPS said she had no comment on the figure published in Le Monde newspaper and industry newsletter Satellifax.</p>
<p>TPS in a joint venture of TF1, France Television, Lyonnaise des Eaux, M6 and Luxembourg's CLT.</p>
<p>TPS and TF1 chairman Patrick Le Lay said on January 9 that the venture had widely surpassed the 10,000 subscriber mark.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
